 "source": "// input values\na = 51;\nb = -170;\n\n// make sure 0 <= a,b\nif (a < 0)\n  a = - a;\nif (b < 0)\n  b = - b;\n\n// compute a mod b\nr = a - (a / b) * b;\n\nwhile (0 < r) {\n  a = b;\n  b = r;\n  r = a - (a / b) * b;\n}\n\nresult = b;"
